---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { AlertCircle } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com"
  description="Legal disclaimer and guidelines for FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Disclaimer', url: '/disclaimer' }]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-12 space-y-8 sm:space-y-10 w-full max-w-full overflow-hidden">
    <div class="text-center space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex p-3 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 rounded-2xl mb-1">
        <AlertCircle class="w-8 h-8 text-amber-700" />
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl min-[360px]:text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-serif">
        Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Important Notice & User Advisory</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md space-y-6 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <div class="p-4 bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 rounded-r-xl text-amber-950 font-medium">
        <strong>Not a Matchmaking Agency:</strong> FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com is purely an automated document formatting and design generator. We are not a matrimonial bureau, matchmaker, or relationship consultancy. We do not introduce prospective brides and grooms, nor do we verify claims made within generated biodatas.
      </div>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-serif">1. Verification of Background & Credentials</h2>
        <p>
          Prospective brides, grooms, and their guardians are strongly advised to independently verify all background information, employment credentials, income claims, and criminal/marital history before entering into any matrimonial agreements or negotiations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-serif">2. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com shall not be held liable for any disputes, misunderstandings, financial damages, or relationship dissolutions arising from the use of biodatas designed through this platform.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
